  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261122-a01",
      "title": "Bimo and the School Garden",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Behind Bimo's school, there is a small garden. Every class has its own square of land. This year, Bimo's class is growing tomatoes and long beans.",
        "Every morning before class, two students water the plants. Today it is Bimo's turn with Sinta. They fill two green watering cans at the tap and carry them carefully. \"Look!\" says Sinta. \"Our first tomato!\" It is small and green, but in two weeks it will be red.",
        "When the vegetables are ready, the class sells them to the teachers. The money buys new books for the class library. Bimo thinks the tomatoes taste better because they grew them themselves."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "garden": "kebun",
        "long beans": "kacang panjang",
        "water": "menyiram",
        "watering cans": "gembor",
        "tap": "keran",
        "carefully": "hati-hati",
        "sells": "menjual",
        "taste better": "terasa lebih enak"
      },
      "qs": [
